# L §5.18: "an ask is checked and answered only in the worlds its line is evaluated in (its in, both worlds of a
# diff, each as if {scenario s} in it)"; L §6.4 Asking: "Inside an expression, x as if {scenario s} is x in s". s1 and
# s2 are each over hh (two stacks that never meet): salary at law 2027-06-30 is 6 000.00 PLN in s1 and 4 000.00 PLN in
# s2 (each replaces the base's row on its span, L §4.6 step 2), so d = 6 000.00 - 4 000.00 = 2 000.00 PLN.
=== hh.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-11-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input salary: money PLN

version v1
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  salary = 5 000.00 PLN "umowa"

ask d: salary as if {scenario s1} - salary as if {scenario s2} law 2027-06-30
=== s1.tally
scenario s1 over hh
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version a
  cite s
  governs 2027-01-01..
  known 2026-10-20
  replace salary = 6 000.00 PLN "s1"
=== s2.tally
scenario s2 over hh
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version b
  cite s
  governs 2027-01-01..
  known 2026-10-20
  replace salary = 4 000.00 PLN "s2"
=== expect
d: 2 000.00 PLN
  world: s1
  world: s2
  law date 2027-06-30, cut 2026-11-15
